{"unit_id":"NelsonLongxiang__dsh-open-a2a-net#feature-1","repo":"NelsonLongxiang/dsh-open-a2a-net","commit":"c12c2998ae1418dcd92168305354a7cc451551b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Open A2A Net 的功能「团队发现与搜索」：通过 a2a_teams 列出本机及已跟踪对等节点上的可达团队，并可用关键词过滤团队名、标题、摘要或工作区。用户调用该工具获取目标团队后，可继续进行消息路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/info.ts:277-290"]}
{"unit_id":"NelsonLongxiang__dsh-open-a2a-net#feature-2","repo":"NelsonLongxiang/dsh-open-a2a-net","commit":"c12c2998ae1418dcd92168305354a7cc451551b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Open A2A Net 的功能「团队消息路由」：通过 a2a_route 向选定团队发送消息，并返回远端回复；可提供 context_id 延续已有对话，也可启用 async 先投递、稍后接收回执。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/act.ts:375-389"]}
{"unit_id":"NelsonLongxiang__dsh-open-a2a-net#feature-3","repo":"NelsonLongxiang/dsh-open-a2a-net","commit":"c12c2998ae1418dcd92168305354a7cc451551b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Open A2A Net 的功能「会话节点侧栏控制」：Web 客户端检测到主机提供会话节点状态后，在侧栏底部注册 A2A 控制入口；控制组件可使用标准会话打开流程唤醒所选会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:44-62"]}
